        <item>
            <title>0.27.11</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:49:12 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>71</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.27.11</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:0;padding:2px 4px}h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 4px}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}}</style><h3>What's new in Keeploop 0.27.11</h3><ul><li>Agents can now answer in the conversation a text came from, group chats included: send_message takes a conversation_id or a message to reply to, as well as a person. A text into a group always asks you first on your Mac and shows the group's name and everyone in it.</li></ul>]]></description>
